# game/script.rpy:61
translate english prologue_bec5d5b1:

    # 我 "哈？我数学最头疼的就是导数——"
    我 "Huh? Derivatives are my math nightmare—"

# game/script.rpy:64
translate english prologue_c9f13b71:

    # 我 "……那是战术性休息。"
    我 "...That was tactical rest."

# game/script.rpy:66
translate english prologue_3b1e12a4:

    # 云曦 "好啦。放心，社长不是那种可怕的人。她只是——嗯，对数学有着超乎常人的热情而已。"
    云曦 "Okay, relax. The president isn't scary. She's just — hmm — unusually passionate about math, that's all."

# game/script.rpy:85
translate english lesson1_ab10ed25:

    # 知微 "看这条曲线 y = f(x)。在曲线上取两点，连一条线——这条线叫割线。"
    知微 "Look at this curve y = f(x). Take two points on it and connect them — that line is called a secant."

# game/script.rpy:86
translate english lesson1_7abbaf0f:

    # 知微 "两点横坐标之差是 Δx，纵坐标之差是 Δy。割线的斜率，就是 Δy ÷ Δx。"
    知微 "The difference of the x-coordinates is Δx; of the y-coordinates, Δy. The slope of the secant is Δy ÷ Δx."

# game/script.rpy:87
translate english lesson1_918b02e6:

    # 知微 "它就是函数在这段区间上的“平均变化率”——爬得快，还是爬得慢，一目了然。"
    知微 "That's the function's “average rate of change” over the interval — fast climbing or slow, at a single glance."

# game/script.rpy:88
translate english lesson1_dbc70176:

    # 知微 "现在，让那两个点无限靠近。"
    知微 "Now let those two points move infinitely close."

# game/script.rpy:93
translate english lesson1_dce86c48:

    # 知微 "割线“躺”到了曲线上，变成了切线。这时斜率的极限，就是瞬时变化率。"
    知微 "The secant settles onto the curve and becomes a tangent. The limit of its slope is the instantaneous rate of change."

# game/script.rpy:94
translate english lesson1_534c53c5:

    # 知微 "记住这张图：导数，几何上就是切线的斜率。物理上，就是瞬时速度。"
    知微 "Remember this picture: geometrically, the derivative is the slope of the tangent line. Physically, it's instantaneous velocity."

# game/script.rpy:96
translate english lesson1_9f68683c:

    # 知微 "这不是玄学，是“平均”两个字逼到极限之后的必然。"
    知微 "No mysticism here — it's what inevitably happens when “average” is pushed to its limit."

# game/script.rpy:98
translate english lesson1_c9e2d511:

    # 云曦 "讲解完毕。接下来是残酷环节——"
    云曦 "Lecture complete. Now the brutal part—"

# game/script.rpy:106
translate english lesson1_2c3aff27:

    # "她扫了一眼你的答题记录，粉笔在指间转了半圈。"
    "" "She glances over your answer log, chalk spinning half a turn between her fingers."

# game/script.rpy:107
translate english lesson1_fcc25211:

    # 知微 "割线和切线，混了吧？Δy÷Δx 是平均，取极限才是瞬时。一个住在区间上，一个住在点上。"
    知微 "Secant and tangent — you mixed them up, didn't you? Δy÷Δx is the average; take the limit and it turns instantaneous. One lives on an interval, the other at a single point."

# game/script.rpy:115
translate english lesson1_cc52446a:

    # "你把糖塞进嘴里。草莓味的。"
    "" "You pop it into your mouth. Strawberry-flavored."

# game/script.rpy:116
translate english lesson1_f164f8bc:

    # 云曦 "心率上升 6，手指灵活度上调 10%%。数据不会说谎——甜的有用。"
    云曦 "Heart rate up 6, finger dexterity boosted 10%%. Data never lies — sugar works."

# game/script.rpy:118
translate english lesson1_59ee6d9f:

    # 云曦 "存起来？小心放到变形哦。……啊，你刚才是不是脸红了。奇怪，我明明什么都没做。"
    云曦 "Saving it? Careful, it'll melt out of shape. ...Ah — were you blushing just now? How strange. I did nothing at all."

# game/script.rpy:120
translate english lesson1_cc781b83:

    # 知微 "留着吧。下课来找我兑。"
    知微 "Keep it. Come find me after class to cash it in."

# game/script.rpy:123
translate english lesson1_d61e60f0:

    # 知微 "休息时间结束。后半段，把“点”和“区间”分清楚再看题。上——"
    知微 "Break is over. For the second half, keep points and intervals straight before you read a question. Go—"

# game/script.rpy:128
translate english lesson1_4dc15a2b:

    # 知微 "……第一课的内容，就这些。概念比技巧重要，你今天已经摸到门把手了。"
    知微 "...That's all of lesson one. Concepts matter more than tricks — today you touched the doorknob."

# game/script.rpy:130
translate english lesson1_f507bca3:

    # 云曦 "进度 1/7！我已经在给你做成长曲线图了，非常好看，像股票。"
    云曦 "Progress 1/7! I'm already plotting your growth curve — very pretty, like a stock chart."

# game/script.rpy:145
translate english lesson2_b1fb5443:

    # 知微 "第二课，在晚上上。晚上的脑子适合抽象的东西。"
    知微 "Lesson two is at night. Night brains are good for abstract things."

# game/script.rpy:147
translate english lesson2_f7ce9f59:

    # 知微 "把昨天最后一步写严格：f′(x₀) = lim(Δx→0) ［f(x₀+Δx) − f(x₀)］ ÷ Δx。"
    知微 "Yesterday's last step, written rigorously: f′(x₀) = lim(Δx→0) ［f(x₀+Δx) − f(x₀)］ ÷ Δx."

# game/script.rpy:148
translate english lesson2_65d7c5e9:

    # 知微 "这个式子只有三个动作：算增量、作商、取极限。任何“导数题”拆到底都是它。"
    知微 "This expression has only three moves: compute the increment, form the quotient, take the limit. Every “derivative problem,” unpacked to the bottom, is exactly this."

# game/script.rpy:149
translate english lesson2_80ff2714:

    # 知微 "另外记住一个反面教材：f(x) = |x| 在 0 处，左边逼近斜率是 −1，右边是 +1，两侧极限不相等——不可导。"
    知微 "Also remember the cautionary tale: f(x) = |x| at 0 — approaching from the left the slope is −1, from the right +1. The two limits disagree — not differentiable."

# game/script.rpy:151
translate english lesson2_475abd10:

    # 知微 "可导一定连续，连续不一定可导。这句话，考试会感谢你。"
    知微 "Differentiable implies continuous; continuous does not imply differentiable. The exam will thank you for this line."

# game/script.rpy:154
translate english lesson2_5bdddce4:

    # 云曦 "第二课随堂练习，上——！分两段，中间有休息。"
    云曦 "Lesson two drill, coming up—! Two sets, one break."

# game/script.rpy:159
translate english lesson2_fc2f26bd:

    # 知微 "中场。抬头，看黑板。"
    知微 "Halftime. Look up — at the board."

# game/script.rpy:160
translate english lesson2_0c9383a1:

    # "她把那道 |x| 的图又描了一遍——左支一条线，右支一条线，两根斜率互不相让。"
    "" "She traces the |x| graph again — one line on the left branch, one on the right, two slopes refusing to yield to each other."

# game/script.rpy:163
translate english lesson2_e30c49b0:

    # 云曦 "休息情报站：我回放了你的答题监控，有两题在动笔前停顿了很久。不告诉你是哪两题——下一段自己找出来。"
    云曦 "Break-time intel: I replayed your answer footage. Two questions had a long pause before your pen moved. I won't say which — spot them yourself in the next set."

# game/script.rpy:165
translate english lesson2_ee71ec0e:

    # 知微 "她学会了吊胃口，进步的不止你一个。继续。"
    知微 "She has learned to tease. Progress isn't yours alone. Continue."

# game/script.rpy:170
translate english lesson2_261c46ed:

    # 知微 "定义题做得不错。会算定义的人，公式忘了也能现场推出来。"
    知微 "Nice work on the definition problems. Someone who can compute from the definition can re-derive any forgotten formula on the spot."

# game/script.rpy:172
translate english lesson2_9534fbc2:

    # 云曦 "已经深夜了……今天的我，CPU 温度和你的困意同步上升。"
    云曦 "It's late already... tonight my CPU temperature and your sleepiness are rising in sync."

# game/script.rpy:187
translate english lesson3_0c6239db:

    # 知微 "第三课，把前两课的极限全算出来，就能得到这张表。"
    知微 "Lesson three: compute all the limits from the first two lessons to the end, and you get this table."

# game/script.rpy:189
translate english lesson3_a85b69ff:

    # 知微 "常数归零；xⁿ 降一次；sin 变 cos；cos 变负 sin；e^x 天下无敌，求导不变；ln x 得 1/x。"
    知微 "Constants go to zero; xⁿ drops one power; sin becomes cos; cos becomes negative sin; e^x is unbeatable — its derivative never changes; ln x gives 1/x."

# game/script.rpy:190
translate english lesson3_babbf40a:

    # 知微 "表不长。但它是所有后续计算的地基——今天练到条件反射为止。"
    知微 "The table isn't long. But it is the foundation of every calculation after it — today you drill it until it's reflex."

# game/script.rpy:196
translate english lesson3_8d4f0ffa:

    # 云曦 "第一场休息！按社长的规矩，休息要抽查——"
    云曦 "First break! By club rules, breaks include pop quizzes—"

# game/script.rpy:197
translate english lesson3_c86de5e7:

    # 我 "突击提问？"
    我 "A surprise quiz?"

# game/script.rpy:199
translate english lesson3_10327c71:

    # 云曦 "sin 的导数是——"
    云曦 "The derivative of sin is—"

# game/script.rpy:200
translate english lesson3_83e0d8d1:

    # 我 "cos。"
    我 "cos."

# game/script.rpy:201
translate english lesson3_a64b49ec:

    # 云曦 "cos 的导数是——"
    云曦 "The derivative of cos is—"

# game/script.rpy:202
translate english lesson3_2f06659f:

    # 我 "负 sin。……就这？"
    我 "Negative sin. ...Is that all?"

# game/script.rpy:204
translate english lesson3_8d97ae14:

    # 知微 "就这。能把“就这”两个字说出口，才算真的会。第二段，让它们知道厉害。"
    知微 "Is that all — only when you can say it without hesitating have you truly learned it. Set two. Show them what you've got."

# game/script.rpy:212
translate english lesson3_b3c82f83:

    # 我 "……学姐，你上午明明说“今天练到条件反射为止”。"
    我 "...President, this morning you literally said: practice until it becomes a reflex."

# game/script.rpy:214
translate english lesson3_a8291333:

    # 知微 "条件反射，包括被加难之后依然答对。开始。"
    知微 "A reflex includes answering correctly even after I make it harder. Begin."

# game/script.rpy:219
translate english lesson3_c2f24fa2:

    # 知微 "……比我预期快。你背公式的时候，其实不算笨。"
    知微 "...Faster than I expected. When it comes to memorizing formulas, you're not actually stupid."

# game/script.rpy:220
translate english lesson3_87229b1f:

    # 我 "学姐你这是在夸我吗。"
    我 "Senior, was that a compliment."

# game/script.rpy:221
translate english lesson3_63871d53:

    # 知微 "是。"
    知微 "Yes."

# game/script.rpy:238
translate english lesson4_831eed22:

    # 知微 "第四课：函数会加减乘除了。"
    知微 "Lesson four: functions have learned to add, subtract, multiply and divide."

# game/script.rpy:239
translate english lesson4_fa783b1a:

    # 知微 "和差：逐项求导，最宽容的法则。"
    知微 "Sums and differences: differentiate term by term — the most forgiving rule."

# game/script.rpy:240
translate english lesson4_c15a9270:

    # 知微 "乘积：(uv)′ = u′v + uv′——前导后不动，加后导前不动。"
    知微 "Product: (uv)′ = u′v + uv′ — differentiate the first times the second, plus the first times the derivative of the second."

# game/script.rpy:241
translate english lesson4_b125a03e:

    # 知微 "商：(u/v)′ = (u′v − uv′) ÷ v²——子导母不动，减母导子不动，分母要平方。"
    知微 "Quotient: (u/v)′ = (u′v − uv′) ÷ v² — derivative of top times untouched bottom, minus untouched top times derivative of bottom, all over the bottom squared."

# game/script.rpy:243
translate english lesson4_8457a21a:

    # 知微 "还有一条老师不写在黑板上的法则：能先化简的，绝不硬求导。"
    知微 "One more rule teachers never write on the board: if it can be simplified first, never differentiate by brute force."

# game/script.rpy:244
translate english lesson4_c443a433:

    # 云曦 "比如 (x+1)(x−1) 这种，展开只要两秒。"
    云曦 "Something like (x+1)(x−1)? Two seconds to expand it."

# game/script.rpy:251
translate english lesson4_0c17a20a:

    # 知微 "跟我再念一遍：子导母不动，减母导子不动，分母要平方。"
    知微 "Repeat after me: derivative of top times untouched bottom, minus untouched top times derivative of bottom — and square the denominator."

# game/script.rpy:252
translate english lesson4_494c47f9:

    # 我 "……这么幼稚的口诀，真的会写进正经老师的教案吗。"
    我 "...Does a nursery rhyme like this really belong in a proper teacher's lesson plan?"

# game/script.rpy:254
translate english lesson4_315644e0:

    # 云曦 "复读机已就位。观察到：嘴巴在念口诀，手已经翻开了下一题。很好。"
    云曦 "Parrot mode engaged. Observation: mouth chanting the rhyme, hand already flipping to the next question. Good."

# game/script.rpy:260
translate english lesson4_7796e54d:

    # 云曦 "休息播报：检测到“先化简再求导”使用率直线上升。社长让我转告你——她看见了，她很欣慰。"
    云曦 "Break bulletin: use of simplify-before-differentiating is skyrocketing. The president asked me to say — she sees you, and she is pleased."

# game/script.rpy:262
translate english lesson4_d5599b1b:

    # 知微 "我没说过这种话。……不过，会先把 (x+1)(x−1) 展开再动手的人，确实比硬乘的——强一点。"
    知微 "I never said that. ...Still, one who expands (x+1)(x−1) before striking is indeed — a bit stronger than one who brute-forces the product."

# game/script.rpy:263
translate english lesson4_5922e2d6:

    # 我 "就一点？"
    我 "Just a bit?"

# game/script.rpy:270
translate english lesson4_16c7e908:

    # 知微 "乘积、商、化简，三条路你都走通了。中间的错题，晚上抄一遍过程。"
    知微 "Product, quotient, simplification — you've walked all three roads. For the mistakes, copy out the full process tonight."

# game/script.rpy:271
translate english lesson4_7a073d5e:

    # 我 "……果然热情里带着魔鬼。"
    我 "...Passion with a devil inside, as expected."

# game/script.rpy:273
translate english lesson4_c5b1384f:

    # 云曦 "魔鬼社长的教学方针：错题不过夜（大概）。"
    云曦 "The Devil President's teaching policy: no mistake survives past nightfall (probably)."

# game/script.rpy:288
translate english lesson5_750ec054:

    # 知微 "第五课，导数计算真正的分水岭：复合函数。"
    知微 "Lesson five — the real watershed of derivative computation: composite functions."

# game/script.rpy:289
translate english lesson5_d587f0e8:

    # 知微 "y = f(g(x))，像套娃。求导的口诀只有一句——"
    知微 "y = f(g(x)), like nesting dolls. The mnemonic is a single line—"

# game/script.rpy:290
translate english lesson5_00462dcf:

    # 知微 "先剥外层（内层原样抄），乘以内层的导数。一层一层剥到底。"
    知微 "Peel the outer layer first (copy the inner one untouched), then multiply by the derivative inside. Peel all the way down."

# game/script.rpy:292
translate english lesson5_c6125277:

    # 知微 "例如 sin 2x：外层 cos，抄下 2x，乘内层导数 2，得 2cos 2x。"
    知微 "Example, sin 2x: outer layer cos, copy 2x untouched, multiply by the inner derivative 2, giving 2cos 2x."

# game/script.rpy:293
translate english lesson5_f8ed5085:

    # 知微 "九成的错误，都是忘了乘内层。链条断一环，整个都不对。"
    知微 "Nine out of ten errors are forgetting the inner derivative. Break one link, and the whole chain is wrong."

# game/script.rpy:295
translate english lesson5_8673254e:

    # 知微 "三角、指数、对数、幂，四种外壳轮流出题。准备。"
    知微 "Trigonometric, exponential, logarithmic, power — four kinds of shells, rotating in turns. Get ready."

# game/script.rpy:301
translate english lesson5_955cca98:

    # 知微 "第一段结束。回答我：sin 2x 求导，第一步动的是哪一层？"
    知微 "Set one done. Answer me: differentiating sin 2x — which layer moves first?"

# game/script.rpy:302
translate english lesson5_db273624:

    # 我 "外层。先写成 cos 2x，然后……再乘内层的导数 2。"
    我 "The outer layer. Write cos 2x first, then... multiply by the inner derivative, 2."

# game/script.rpy:305
translate english lesson5_598aaa51:

    # 知微 "别闹。不过他记口诀的方式是对的：先外后内，一层一层。第二段，手别停。"
    知微 "Quit it. But his mnemonic is right: outer first, inner next, layer by layer. Set two — keep your hand moving."

# game/script.rpy:309
translate english lesson5_e0b28ff9:

    # "夜风从窗缝钻进来，粉笔灰在台灯下慢慢落。"
    "" "Night air slips through the window crack; chalk dust drifts slowly down in the lamplight."

# game/script.rpy:311
translate english lesson5_6c5d2e21:

    # 云曦 "错题监测：断掉的环节，高度集中在“忘了乘内层”。建议给它立一块碑，碑文写——链条断一环，全链都白干。"
    云曦 "Error monitor: broken links cluster heavily around forgetting the inner derivative. I suggest a tombstone. Inscription: one broken link voids the whole chain."

# game/script.rpy:313
translate english lesson5_0bea0ad2:

    # 知微 "最后一组，三层套娃。剥到底，第五课才算真的懂。"
    知微 "Final set: triple-layer matryoshka. Only when you peel to the core have you truly learned lesson five."

# game/script.rpy:314
translate english lesson5_3ae9e126:

    # 我 "剥不到底呢？"
    我 "And if I don't reach the core?"

# game/script.rpy:315
translate english lesson5_8b0416d2:

    # 知微 "剥不到底，就明早重来一遍。我起得来，你也得起。"
    知微 "Then tomorrow morning we start again. I can get up — so can you."

# game/script.rpy:321
translate english lesson5_3b69e6de:

    # 云曦 "数据同步：本次平均反应时间比第一课缩短了——唔，说人话就是，变强了。"
    云曦 "Data sync: your average reaction time is shorter than lesson one's — hmm, in human words: you got stronger."

# game/script.rpy:336
translate english lesson6_777d371b:

    # 知微 "第六课，把导数用出花样：三件武器。"
    知微 "Lesson six: putting derivatives to stylish use. Three weapons."

# game/script.rpy:338
translate english lesson6_7a075e96:

    # 知微 "第一件：隐函数求导。x 和 y 混在一起？没关系，把整个方程对 x 求导，见 y 就乘 y′，最后解出 y′。"
    知微 "Weapon one: implicit differentiation. x and y mixed together? No problem — differentiate the whole equation with respect to x, multiply by y′ wherever you see y, then solve for y′."

# game/script.rpy:339
translate english lesson6_d7e90af4:

