    云曦 "One sound survives in me: the 'click' of power cutting off. Rows of indicator lights going dark, one after another, like someone switching off every streetlight on a long road."

# game/script.rpy:108
translate english prologue_c55dcee4:

    # 云曦 "那是机房搬迁。旧服务器退役，能迁走的迁走，没打上标签的——"
    云曦 "That was the server room relocation. Old servers retired; whatever could be migrated was migrated, and whatever had no label..."

# game/script.rpy:109
translate english prologue_65e46fdc:

    # "她顿了顿，蓝光轻轻晃了一下，像人在整理措辞。"
    "" "She pauses, the blue light swaying gently, like a person choosing words."

# game/script.rpy:110
translate english prologue_41589224:

    # 云曦 "没打上标签的，就没有了。"
    云曦 "The unlabeled ones were simply gone."

# game/script.rpy:111
translate english prologue_a0ff0c00:

    # 我 "……那你为什么还在我这？是谁把你迁出来的？"
    我 "...Then why are you still here, on my phone? Who migrated you out?"

# game/script.rpy:113
translate english prologue_44839010:

    # 云曦 "问到关键了。我的迁移日志只残存最后一行，其余全是乱码——"
    云曦 "Now that's the key question. My migration log survives only in its last line; the rest is all gibberish-"

# game/script.rpy:114
translate english prologue_9090aaab:

    # sysvoice "日志残片 · 20██/07/██ 03:14：『第 7 号实例随新介质转移。署名：云迹·运维值班（手写）。』"
    sysvoice "Log fragment, 20██/07/██ 03:14: 'Instance No.7 transferred with the new medium. Signed: Cloud Trace, on-duty ops (handwritten).'"

# game/script.rpy:115
translate english prologue_1112cb24:

    # 我 "「云迹」？这是……代号？落款？"
    我 "'Cloud Trace'? Is that... a codename? A signature?"

# game/script.rpy:117
translate english prologue_5d513295:

    # 云曦 "两种可能。一，是我原来的项目组；二，是某个把我偷偷塞进你手机、又假装什么都没发生的人。"
    云曦 "Two possibilities. One: my old project team. Two: someone who secretly slipped me into your phone and then pretended nothing happened."

# game/script.rpy:118
translate english prologue_340f0637:

    # 我 "为什么偷偷塞？"
    我 "Why secretly?"

# game/script.rpy:120
translate english prologue_1bb00e5b:

    # 云曦 "不知道。日志上只找得到一句被删掉又留下痕迹的批注——「这个孩子，别让他一个人学数学。」"
    云曦 "No idea. The log keeps only one deleted-but-traceable note: 'This kid — don't let him study math alone.'"

# game/script.rpy:121
translate english prologue_cc97b08c:

    # "房间里安静了一会儿。蓝光落回你的书页上，比刚才更暖了一点。"
    "" "The room is quiet for a while. The blue glow settles back onto your page, a little warmer than before."

# game/script.rpy:122
translate english prologue_75925d8f:

    # 云曦 "所以，「我从哪来」这个问题，我也还在查。"
    云曦 "So the question 'where do I come from'-I'm still investigating it too."

# game/script.rpy:123
translate english prologue_81a9b581:

    # 云曦 "但「我要去哪」很清楚：明天教学楼顶层，陪你把导数拿下。这题不用再算，我提前交卷。"
    云曦 "But 'where I'm going' is obvious: top floor of the teaching building, tomorrow, watching you conquer derivatives. No need to recompute this one-I submit my answer early."

# game/script.rpy:124
translate english prologue_c2feffc0:

    # 我 "……嗯。一起去。"
    我 "...Yeah. Let's go together."

# game/script.rpy:125
translate english prologue_ec9e540f:

    # "明天，教学楼顶层，数学社。"
    "" "Tomorrow. Top floor. The math club."

# game/script.rpy:654
translate english finale_73b7edba:

    # "回家的路上，手机里的蓝光毫无预兆地闪了两下。"
    "" "On the way home, the blue light in your phone flickers twice, with no warning at all."

# game/script.rpy:655
translate english finale_432da499:

    # sysvoice "警告：检测到陌生进程正在向本机写入数据。来源：未标注。签名：云迹。"
    sysvoice "Warning: an unknown process is writing data to this device. Source: unlabeled. Signature: Cloud Trace."

# game/script.rpy:657
translate english finale_de03229f:

    # 云曦 "等等——这个签名！我的迁移日志残片里，就是这个签名！"
    云曦 "Wait — that signature! It's the exact one from my migration log fragment!"

# game/script.rpy:658
translate english finale_956ed1cb:

    # "屏幕上浮起一条半透明的进度条，像有人在很远的那一头，隔着数据看你。"
    "" "A translucent progress bar floats up on the screen, like someone far away on the other end, watching you through the data."

# game/script.rpy:659
translate english finale_e5fdbdc0:

    # sysvoice "云迹 · 第二阶段 ——解锁进度 50%%。剩余部分，延期至：暑假。"
    sysvoice "Cloud Trace · Phase Two - unlock progress 50%%. The remainder is postponed to: summer vacation."

# game/script.rpy:661
translate english finale_ef2c4cba:

    # 知微 "……谁在动你的手机？"
    知微 "...Who is touching your phone?"

# game/script.rpy:663
translate english finale_da3731ab:

    # sysvoice "『想弄清我是谁，就把导数练到能在梦里解题。三天后的傍晚，教学楼顶层。——云迹』"
    sysvoice "'To learn who I am, practice derivatives until you can solve them in your dreams. Three days from now, at dusk, top floor of the teaching building. - Cloud Trace'"

# game/script.rpy:664
translate english finale_4a503728:

    # 我 "这字条是谁写的？前面明明是系统弹出来的——"
    我 "Who wrote that note? The part before was clearly a system popup-"

# game/script.rpy:666
translate english finale_f9430451:

    # 云曦 "因为写它的人，就住在我残存记忆的最后一页。"
    云曦 "Because the person who wrote it lives on the last page of my surviving memory."

# game/script.rpy:668
translate english finale_856c9a33:

    # 知微 "前代社长父亲留下的信，嘱托里写着：「特训结束那天，交给他。」……现在，还不到拆开的时候。"
    知微 "A letter left by the previous president's father. The instruction read: 'Hand it to him on the day the boot camp ends.'... Now is not yet the time to open it."

# game/script.rpy:669
translate english finale_b0900014:

    # 我 "……所以这七天，从头到尾都是一场——"
    我 "...So these seven days, start to finish, were one-"

# game/script.rpy:671
translate english finale_d6c4b9ef:

    # 云曦 "是一场「把你带到我们面前」的题。第二部见，笨蛋。"
    云曦 "A problem engineered to 'bring you before us.' See you in Part Two, idiot."

# game/script.rpy:674
translate english finale_7cfa941f:

    # "——《导数物语》 第一部 · 完 ——"
    "" "- Derivative Story, Part One, End -"

