translate english finale_812a7869:

    # sysvoice "错题本上还留着 [len(persistent.wrong_ids)] 题——它们会跟着你进二周目。"
    sysvoice "[len(persistent.wrong_ids)] questions are still waiting in the notebook — they'll follow you into a second playthrough."

