# game/script.rpy:117
translate english prologue_f4488ed2:

    # 我 "……这句「早上好」，我是第 [_runs] 次听到了。"
    我 "...That 'good morning' - you've said it to me [_runs] times now."

# game/script.rpy:118
translate english prologue_6b6bba79:

    # 云曦 "记录核对：同一句开场白，播放 [_runs] 遍。但你听不懂的那部分，每一遍都是新的。"
    云曦 "Log check: the same opening line, played [_runs] times. But the part you don't understand is new every single time."

# game/script.rpy:121
translate english prologue_97d34952:

    # 云曦 "那这次换个玩法：你负责提前知道，我负责提前假装不知道。同一份剧本，走出第二条路。"
    云曦 "Then let's change the game this round: you get to know in advance, I get to pretend I don't. Same script, second path."

# game/script.rpy:636
translate english finale_a4e277e6:

    # 知微 "第 [_runs] 次听这张成绩单，我还是把同样的话说一遍：你本来就可以。"
    知微 "Report card number [_runs] I sit through, and I'll still say the same thing: you were always capable."

# game/script.rpy:637
translate english finale_6b613cda:

    # 知微 "区别是——上次你被我拖进来，这次是你自己走进来的。这一条比分数值钱。"
    知微 "The difference is — last time I dragged you in. This time you walked in yourself. That's worth more than the score."

