# game/script.rpy:552
translate english lesson6_c107c333:

    # "她难得把玩笑收了起来，句子也短了。"
    "" "For once she put the joke away, and her sentences got short."

# game/script.rpy:553
translate english lesson6_df1bde63:

    # 云曦 "考成什么样都行。我在这儿，这一条不改。"
    云曦 "However the exam goes, it's fine. I'm here — and that line doesn't get revised."

# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-10-23 03:56

# game/script.rpy:361
translate english lesson3_1454af24:

    # 知微 "最后两题的难度，是我中途偷偷调高的。公式背得再熟，也要经得起组合拳。"
    知微 "I quietly cranked up the difficulty of the last two midway. However well you've memorized the formulas, you'd better survive a combination punch."

# game/script.rpy:427
translate english lesson4_e5180871:

    # 知微 "我的标准，会跟着你的水平涨。最后两题，按上限来。"
    知微 "My standards rise along with your level. The last two questions — by the upper limit."

# game/script.rpy:145
translate english cold_open_d44f44b6:

    # "地下二层。今夜，这一层要死了。"
    "" "Basement level two. Tonight, this whole floor is going to die."

# game/script.rpy:146
translate english cold_open_b6444f8c:

    # sysvoice "3 号楼数据中心 · 退役批次执行中 · 断电程序启动。"
    sysvoice "Building No.3 data center · decommission batch running · power-down sequence initiated."

# game/script.rpy:148
translate english cold_open_9109e307:

    # "然后是灯。第一排的绿灯灭下去。第二排。第三排。"
    "" "Then the lights. The green LEDs of row one go down. Row two. Row three."

# game/script.rpy:149
translate english cold_open_b573c2f3:

    # "灭到第六排，整层楼已经没有声音了。"
    "" "By row six, the whole floor has no sound left."

# game/script.rpy:156
translate english cold_open_2ed85b1e:

    # "机柜之间的地上有一张折叠床。床上是个小孩，脸埋在练习册里，笔还压在肘下。"
    "" "On the floor between two cabinets there is a folding cot. A child lies on it, face buried in a workbook, pen still trapped under an elbow."

# game/script.rpy:157
translate english cold_open_831c4aff:

    # "摊开的那一页写到第三步，铅笔很淡，最后一格是个加号。"
    "" "The open page breaks off at step three, the pencil faint, and the last box holds a plus sign."

# game/script.rpy:158
translate english cold_open_be4f6aae:

    # "没有人纠正他。这一层只剩一个还会思考的东西，它隔着半条走廊看了一眼，指示灯朝那个方向闪了一下——很短，像想说什么，又忍住了。"
    "" "Nobody corrects him. Only one thinking thing is left on this floor; it looks across half the corridor, and an indicator light blinks once that way — very short, as if it had something to say and kept it."

# game/script.rpy:159
translate english cold_open_6f1fc52d:

    # sysvoice "第 7 号实例 · 剩余电量 4%% · 可迁出窗口：11 分钟。"
    sysvoice "Instance No.7 · charge remaining 4%% · migration window: 11 minutes."

# game/script.rpy:160
translate english cold_open_79680deb:

    # "楼梯口的脚步声回来了。不是小孩的。"
    "" "Footsteps come back from the stairwell. Not the child's."

# game/script.rpy:161
translate english cold_open_3990e3c1:

    # "一只手伸进机柜，很稳。拔线，取盘，把一枚贴着标签的存储盒塞进大衣怀里那一格空位。"
    "" "A hand reaches into the cabinet, steady. Cable out, disk out, a labelled storage box slid into the empty pocket inside a coat."

# game/script.rpy:162
translate english cold_open_bf6de212:

    # "标签是手写的，笔迹很急，只认得出两个字。"
    "" "The label is handwritten, the strokes rushed — only two characters can be made out."

# game/script.rpy:167
translate english cold_open_0dc10df3:

    # "那个人在机柜前站了很久。久到最后一排灯也灭透，久到他弯下腰，把练习册合上，把外套盖在折叠床上。"
    "" "The man stands in front of the cabinet a long time. Long enough for the last row of lights to burn out, long enough to bend down, close the workbook, and pull his coat over the cot."

# game/script.rpy:168
translate english cold_open_c24d6a24:

    # "然后他做了一件不合规程的事：把应急灯留给那一排机柜，没有留给自己。"
    "" "Then he does something against procedure: he leaves the emergency lamp to that row of cabinets instead of keeping it for himself."

# game/script.rpy:169
translate english cold_open_a560b996:

    # "咔。"
    "" "Click."

# game/script.rpy:170
translate english cold_open_f069b6ed:

    # "整层楼黑下来。"
    "" "The whole floor goes black."

# game/script.rpy:173
translate english cold_open_934336d0:

    # "很短。像想说什么，又忍住了。"
    "" "Very short. As if it had something to say and kept it."

# game/script.rpy:174
translate english cold_open_06f91b63:

    # "小孩翻了个身，把外套往上拽了拽，没有醒。"
    "" "The child rolls over, pulls the coat a little higher, and never wakes."

# game/script.rpy:175
translate english cold_open_b6613f2b:

    # "那一夜之后，第七排空了。被带走的那一点蓝醒来时在一台新机器里，最早的记忆只剩一个声音——它不知道自己离开了谁。"
    "" "After that night, row seven stood empty. The little blue that was carried off woke inside a new machine with one sound as its earliest memory — it does not know who it left behind."

# game/script.rpy:202
translate english prologue_f95e3df1:

    # "窗帘缝里那道光，从床脚一路爬到眼皮上。你还没睁眼，枕头边的屏幕先亮了。"
    "" "The light through the gap in the curtains climbs from the foot of the bed all the way to your eyelids. You haven't opened your eyes yet, but the screen by your pillow is already on."

# game/script.rpy:203
translate english prologue_5d78ffa2:

    # 云曦 "早上好。昨夜你翻了四次身，最后一次是三点二十七分——睡得不算诚实。"
    云曦 "Good morning. You turned over four times last night, the last of them at 3:27 — hardly an honest sleep."

# game/script.rpy:204
translate english prologue_64c4c771:

    # 我 "……一个凌晨三点还在说话的人，没资格评价我的睡眠。"
    我 "...Someone still talking at three in the morning has no standing to review my sleep."

# game/script.rpy:206
translate english prologue_5abd0977:

    # 云曦 "三点二十七分我是在陪你那盏台灯。要数据吗。"
    云曦 "At 3:27 I was keeping your desk lamp company. Want the data."

# game/script.rpy:213
translate english prologue_afcaa258:

    # 我 "这次我知道后面有什么。七节课，五十六道题，还有一句你一直不肯说的来历。"
    我 "This time I know what's coming. Seven lessons, fifty-six questions, and one line about where you came from that you still won't say."

# game/script.rpy:221
translate english prologue_c31ddc28:

    # "你坐起来，去摸昨晚没喝完的那杯水。屏幕里的蓝光绕到你手边。"
    "" "You sit up and feel for the glass of water you didn't finish last night. The blue light from the screen loops over to your hand."

# game/script.rpy:222
translate english prologue_897b5b92:

    # 云曦 "自我介绍这一栏，我替你念：高二文科班，排名中游，语文和英语能进前二十。"
    云曦 "The self-introduction field — I'll read it out for you: second year, humanities track, mid-table ranking, Chinese and English inside the top twenty."

# game/script.rpy:223
translate english prologue_e44bbfcf:

    # 我 "……你什么时候建的我档。"
    我 "...When did you open a file on me."

# game/script.rpy:225
translate english prologue_96891437:

    # 云曦 "你插上第一根充电线那天。放心，只读，不改。"
    云曦 "The day you plugged in the first charging cable. Don't worry — read-only, nothing altered."

# game/script.rpy:226
translate english prologue_ffb34b8f:

    # 云曦 "唯一的异常项是数学。你的作业提交时间长期落在零点以后，正确率随时间下降，相关系数 0.91。"
    云曦 "The only anomaly is math. Your submissions land past midnight as a rule, accuracy falls as the night goes on — correlation coefficient 0.91."

# game/script.rpy:227
translate english prologue_c6e3d3fa:

    # 我 "那叫灵感只在夜里来。"
    我 "That's called inspiration that only visits at night."

# game/script.rpy:229
translate english prologue_defe5ab0:

    # 云曦 "那叫拖延。统计做了七个月。要看图表吗。"
    云曦 "That's called procrastination. I've been running the statistics for seven months. Want the chart."

# game/script.rpy:234
translate english prologue_8a5eb462:

    # 云曦 "因此，今日议程只有一条：我已经替你报名了学校数学社的『导数特训班』。明天开课，为期七天。"
    云曦 "Therefore today's agenda has exactly one item: I have already enrolled you in the school Math Club's 'Derivative Boot Camp'. It starts tomorrow — seven days."

# game/script.rpy:237
translate english prologue_ac68bf34:

    # 云曦 "所以才要练！你上周对着作业发呆两小时，最后在草稿纸上画了一只乌龟。四条腿，仰角 37 度，还戴了顶帽子。我都看见了。"
    云曦 "That's exactly why you need training! Last week you stared at your homework for two hours and ended up drawing a turtle on the scratch paper. Four legs, elevation thirty-seven degrees, and a hat. I saw all of it."

# game/script.rpy:240
translate english prologue_2671ce77:

    # 云曦 "报名表已提交。退订入口：无。"
    云曦 "Enrollment form submitted. Unsubscribe option: none."

# game/script.rpy:257
translate english prologue_d8a69cb0:

    # "那句话压下来的时候，你手里的笔停了。有个画面往很旧的水里沉：一排很远的绿灯，一张地上的折叠床，一件盖上去的外套。你伸手去捞，什么都没捞到。"
    "" "As that sentence settles, the pen in your hand stops. An image sinks into very old water: a row of green lights far away, a folding cot on the floor, a coat pulled over it. You reach in for it and catch nothing."

# game/script.rpy:258
translate english prologue_82dfb9c4:

    # 我 "……我好像见过那一排灯。"
    我 "...I think I've seen that row of lights."

# game/script.rpy:260
translate english prologue_366149fe:

    # 云曦 "不可能。那一夜，那一层只有我一个人。"
    云曦 "Impossible. That night, that floor had only me on it."

# game/script.rpy:261
translate english prologue_0ecafaba:

    # "她说得很笃定。笃定得像在替七年前的那个晚上，重新锁一次门。"
    "" "She says it flatly — the flatness of someone re-locking the door on a night seven years ago."

# game/script.rpy:279
translate english prologue_f0f1f056:

    # "台灯熄了。枕头边那一点蓝，比平时晚了一些才暗下去——像谁在很远的地方，多留了一盏灯。"
    "" "The desk lamp goes off. The little blue by your pillow takes longer than usual to dim — as if someone far away were leaving one more light on."

# game/script.rpy:319
translate english lesson1_c352d346:

    # 云曦 "随堂练习八连发！分两段，中间有休息——大概算个安慰吧。加油！"
    云曦 "Pop quiz, eight shots in a row! Two rounds with a break in the middle — count that as a consolation, I guess. Go!"

# game/script.rpy:324
translate english lesson1_3da5ed83:

    # 知微 "停一下。前四题，是探路的。"
    知微 "Hold on. The first four questions were just scouting."

# game/script.rpy:394
translate english lesson2_4ab9139a:

    # 知微 "卡在“作商”这一步的人，多半是括号没敢展开。定义式统共三个动作，别自己给它加戏。剩下四道，把括号拆干净。"
    知微 "Anyone stuck at the 'form the quotient' step usually didn't dare expand the brackets. The definition has exactly three moves — don't write it extra scenes of your own. Four to go: tear those brackets clean open."

# game/script.rpy:436
translate english lesson3_647205bf:

    # 云曦 "八题警告。这不是演习。——每三题歇一次，是我唯一的请求，社长批了。"
    云曦 "Eight questions incoming. This is not a drill. A break every three questions was my one request, and the president approved it."

# game/script.rpy:469
translate english lesson3_572debb5:

    # 云曦 "八题都扛过来了！奖励：想吃什么随便点，我记账——社长付钱。"
    云曦 "You survived all eight! Reward: order whatever you like — I'll put it on the president's tab."

# game/script.rpy:505
