# game/script.rpy:306
translate english lesson1_2dd6f262:

    # 知微 "一辆车开了两小时，导航说全程平均时速八十。可仪表盘上，总有那么一刻指到了一百。这辆车，骗人了吗？"
    知微 "A car drives for two hours. The GPS says its average speed was eighty — but the speedometer touched one hundred at least once. Is the car lying?"

# game/script.rpy:312
translate english lesson1_0933f5e8:

    # 知微 "答对。平均，是把整段路揉成一团算；那一刻，只是那一刻。"
    知微 "Correct. An average squeezes the whole road into one number — that moment is just that moment."

# game/script.rpy:313
translate english lesson1_79172aac:

    # 云曦 "记录：开场即答对，本课难度曲线下调一档。"
