# game/script.rpy:316
translate english lesson1_87a02e87:

    # 知微 "记住这个不确定。下课前，你会自己把它拆开。"
    知微 "Hold on to that uncertainty. Before this lesson ends, you'll take it apart yourself."

# game/script.rpy:367
translate english lesson1_ce74acfe:

    # 知微 "对了——课前那辆「平均八十」的车，你心里有答案了吧。"
